From 7a21e66938765a751a02bd62406d3e70d88b2a57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qiyinxi <qiyinxi@foxmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:56:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 115/116] MAS local: keep hw.initialOrientation for an AVD's
 own magic skin

A portrait instance (ModAVDManager keeps the 1280x720 / 1920x1080 screen
and sets hw.initialOrientation=portrait) started with a landscape window:
the AVD has no skin.name, so avdInfo makes it a magic skin from its own
hw.lcd.width / height, "1280x720", and parse_skin_files() then set
hw.initialOrientation to that skin's shape (b/307180733), landscape. The
window started at 0, the boot setting of the rotate button wrote
user_rotation 0, the manager then set 3, and the picture lay on its side
in a landscape window.

A magic skin of the AVD's own screen now leaves an orientation config.ini
gives alone (magic_skin_overrides_orientation()); a -skin of another shape
still overrides it, as upstream. With portrait kept the skin picks its
auto-generated "portrait" layout (90 on a landscape screen), the window
starts portrait, the device's coarse orientation is set to it, the rotate
button's boot setting writes user_rotation 3 and the button turns between
portrait and landscape. Landscape instances are unchanged.

Test: aemu-ui-lean-window_unittests (58), aemu-ui-safe-shutdown_unittests
(17).

Refs ModAVD/ModAVD#225

Change-Id: I5067f46dc8fa8cb3df3ad9e2dfbd269189f13e6e
---
 .../include/android/magic-skin-orientation.h  | 36 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../src/android/skin/user-config.c            | 28 ++++++++++-----
 .../android/lean-title-bar-logic_unittest.cpp | 13 +++++++
 3 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 android/android-ui/modules/aemu-ui-window/include/android/magic-skin-orientation.h

diff --git a/android/android-ui/modules/aemu-ui-window/include/android/magic-skin-orientation.h b/android/android-ui/modules/aemu-ui-window/include/android/magic-skin-orientation.h
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..cf00391f1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/android/android-ui/modules/aemu-ui-window/include/android/magic-skin-orientation.h
@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
